  "Description": "Includes Dovetail® Micro-C library prep, targeted enrichment using the human Dovetail® Pan Promoter Enrichment Panel, sequencing to a minimum of 150M read-pairs and computational data processing.",
  "Statement of Work": "Cantata Micro-C Library Preparation Cantata will process the Sample with the Cantata Micro-C Kit to produce proximity ligation libraries. Each Micro-C proximity ligation library will be shallow-sequenced and run through our QC pipeline to assess library quality. Libraries that do not pass QC will be repeated once. Upon second failure, customer will be informed and the project will be closed and billed accordingly.DTG will process the Sample with the Dovetail Micro-C Kit to produce proximity ligation libraries. Each Micro-C proximity ligation library will be sequenced to assess library quality. Libraries that do not pass QC will be repeated once. Upon second failure, customer will be informed and the project will be closed and billed accordingly. Passing libraries will be enriched by hybrid capture using the Dovetail® Pan Promoter Enrichment Panel."
}

